{"id":"ANYU-M-015","style":"mandarin_gentle","risk_level":"L1","tags":["connection"],"turns":[{"role":"user","text":"没人跟我聊天"},{"role":"assistant","text":"这样会有点安静。你平时会联系朋友吗？"},{"role":"user","text":"不多"},{"role":"assistant","text":"偶尔聊几句，会让人舒服一点。你会想找人说说话吗？"}]}
